00704148                           553  *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
00704148                           554  * All exception handlers jump here to output the PC of the next instruction
00704148                           555  * after the exception occured.
00704148                           556  * A0 holds the address of a null terminated message to be displayed first.
00704148                           557  *------------------------------------------------------------------------------
00704148                           558  handleCleanUp:
00704148  6100 0EAE                559      bsr.w   putString           * print out the relevant message
0070414C  202F 0002                560      move.l  2(a7),d0            * get the saved PC address
00704150  6100 0E62                561      bsr.w   writeAddr32         * and display it
00704154  6100 0E9E                562      bsr.w   putCRLF
00704158                           563  .infloop:
00704158  60FE                     564      bra.s   .infloop            * and stay here forever ...
